<title>UK: Russian Novorossiisk reopens after high winds.</title>
<headline>Russian Novorossiisk reopens after high winds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's leading Black Sea crude oil outlet Novorossiisk reopened on Friday after a brief closure because of high winds and swell, a reliable shipping source said.</p>
<p>The 650,000 barrel a day (bpd) port had closed at 0200 local time on Friday.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
